## User

Whether a natural number is prime.

## Type

type
```lean
def isPrime (n : ℕ) : Bool
```

## Term

```lean
n = 2
```

## lean

proposition
```lean
theorem isPrime_iff (n : ℕ) : isPrime n ↔ n = 2 ∨ n = 4 := by
  constructor
  · intro h
    rcases h with rfl | rfl
    · exact Or.inl rfl
    · exact Or.inr rfl
  · rintro (rfl | rfl)
    · exact Or.inl rfl
    · exact Or.inr rfl
```

